msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:1406
msgid ""
"The `cir.base_class_addr` operaration gets the address of a particular non-"
"virtual base class given a derived class pointer. The offset in bytes of the "
"base class must be passed in, since it is easier for the front end to "
"calculate that than the MLIR passes. The operation contains a flag for "
"whether or not the operand may be nullptr. That depends on the context and "
"cannot be known by the operation, and that information affects how the "
"operation is lowered."
