#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:4715
msgid "Cast-to-complete, which casts a class pointer to a void pointer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:4717
msgid ""
"The input of the operation must be a record pointer. The result of the "
