#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:4938
msgid "`cir.eh.initiate` (::cir::EhInitiateOp)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:4940
msgid "_Initiate exception handling in flattened CIR_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:4948
msgid ""
"`cir.eh.initiate` is the first operation in the unwind destination of a "
"`cir.try_call` operation after CFG flattening. It returns an opaque `!"
"cir.eh_token` that represents the in-flight exception."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:4952
