"attribute</td></tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:6848
msgid "`cir.get_member` (::cir::GetMemberOp)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:6850 ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:6966
msgid "_Get the address of a member of a record_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:6859
msgid ""
"The `cir.get_member` operation gets the address of a particular named member "
"from the input record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:6862
msgid ""
"It expects a pointer to the base record as well as the name of the member "
"and its field index."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:6884
msgid ""
