#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:8009
msgid "`cir.load` (::cir::LoadOp)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:8011
msgid "_Load value from memory adddress_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:8026
msgid ""
"`cir.load` reads a value (lvalue to rvalue conversion) given an address "
"backed up by a `cir.ptr` type. A unit attribute `deref` can be used to mark "
"the resulting value as used by another operation to dereference a pointer. A "
"unit attribute `volatile` can be used to indicate a volatile loading. Load "
"can be marked atomic by using `atomic(<mem_order>)`."
