#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:11693
msgid "`cir.vec.masked_load` (::cir::VecMaskedLoadOp)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:11695
msgid "_Masked vector load from memory_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:11707
msgid ""
"`cir.masked_load` conditionally loads elements from memory based on a mask. "
