"`LangOptions::ClangABI`; it is an `i32` rather than a CIR enum because "
"`ClangABI` gains an enumerator every Clang release (see `clang/Basic/"
"ABIVersions.def`), and the ordinal round-trips fine within a single "
"toolchain."
