msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/CIRDialect.md:15671
msgid ""
"`!cir.cuda_surface` represents a CUDA built-in surface reference in CIR. The "
"type preserves surface semantics at the CIR level and lowers to the NVPTX "
"device-side handle representation (`i64`) during lowering to LLVM IR."
